<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>White Room — Think. Solve. Grow.</title>
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Crect x='1' y='1' width='30' height='30' rx='8' fill='%231f5fff' stroke='%2310162f' stroke-width='3'/%3E%3Ctext x='16' y='24' font-size='22' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-weight='700' fill='%23fff'%3E%CF%80%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Gaegu:wght@400;700&family=Patrick+Hand&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
<section id="auth" class="auth-screen">
  <div class="auth-card">
    <div class="brand auth-brand"><span class="mark">π</span><span class="name">White Room</span></div>
    <p class="label">Private learning room</p>
    <h1 class="display auth-title">Enter the room.<br><span class="b">Earn your rank.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">White Room is a selected-user platform. Student accounts are admitted by head staff.</p>
    <div class="auth-tabs"><button class="auth-tab on" data-auth="studentLogin">Student login</button><button class="auth-tab" data-auth="register">New student</button><button class="auth-tab" data-auth="staffLogin">Staff</button></div>
    <form id="studentLogin" class="auth-form">
      <label>Student ID<input id="loginId" autocomplete="username" required placeholder="WR-2026-0001"></label>
      <label>Password<input id="loginPassword" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required></label>
      <button class="btn blue" type="submit">Enter White Room →</button><p id="loginNote" class="note"></p>
    </form>
    <form id="register" class="auth-form" hidden>
      <label>Admission key<input id="regKey" required placeholder="WRK-XXXXXXXXXX"></label>
      <div class="form-grid"><label>Full name<input id="regName" required></label><label>Class<input id="regClass" required placeholder="Upper Sixth"></label></div>
      <label>School<input id="regSchool" required></label>
      <div class="form-grid"><label>Gender<select id="regGender"><option>Male</option><option>Female</option><option>Other</option><option>Prefer not to say</option></select></label><label>Level / grading<input id="regLevel" required placeholder="A-Level / Form 5"></label></div>
      <label>Create password<input id="regPassword" type="password" minlength="6" required></label>
      <button class="btn blue" type="submit">Create student account</button><p id="regNote" class="note"></p>
    </form>
    <form id="staffLogin" class="auth-form" hidden>
      <label>Head-staff unique code<input id="staffCode" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required></label>
      <button class="btn blue" type="submit">Open staff room →</button><p id="staffNote" class="note"></p>
    </form>
    <p class="note">Admission is controlled. Do not share your student ID or password.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div id="appShell" hidden>
<header class="top"><div class="wrap bar">
  <a class="brand" href="#home"><span class="mark">π</span><span class="name">White Room</span></a>
  <nav class="tabs" id="tabs" aria-label="Main">
    <span id="studentNavGroup"><a href="#home" data-r="home">Dashboard</a><a href="#lessons" data-r="lessons">Lessons</a><a href="#tasks" data-r="tasks">Daily Quest</a><a href="#compete" data-r="compete">Compete</a><a href="#rankings" data-r="rankings">Rankings</a><a href="#profile" data-r="profile">Profile</a></span><span id="staffNavGroup" hidden><a href="#staff" data-r="staff">Staff Dashboard</a><a href="#staff-review" data-r="staff-review">Marking Review</a><a href="#staff-students" data-r="staff-students">Students</a><a href="#staff-admissions" data-r="staff-admissions">Admissions</a><a href="#staff-compete" data-r="staff-compete">Competitions</a></span>
  </nav>
  <span id="status" class="status">Online</span><button id="logoutBtn" class="btn white sm">Log out</button><button id="menuBtn" class="menu-btn" aria-label="Menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="tabs"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
</div></header>
<main>
<section id="home" class="view"><div class="wrap dashboard">
  <div class="dash-hero"><div><p class="label">WHITE ROOM // STUDENT HQ</p><h1 class="display">Welcome back,<br><span class="b" id="dashName">Student.</span></h1><p class="lead">Your progress is your power. Complete lessons, clear daily quests, earn XP and climb the ranks.</p></div><div class="rank-card"><span class="rank-ring" id="dashRank">E</span><div><p class="label">Current rank</p><h2 id="dashRankTitle">Novice</h2><p><b id="dashXp">0</b> XP</p></div></div></div>
  <div class="stat-grid"><div class="stat-card"><span>Lessons</span><b id="statLessons">0</b></div><div class="stat-card"><span>Quest marks</span><b id="statMarks">0%</b></div><div class="stat-card"><span>Streak</span><b id="statStreak">0 days</b></div><div class="stat-card"><span>Achievements</span><b id="statAchievements">0</b></div></div>
  <div class="dash-grid"><section><div class="section-head"><div><p class="label">Today's route</p><h2 class="big small">Keep moving.</h2></div></div><div class="cards"><a class="card art" href="#tasks"><div class="dash-icon">⚔</div><div><p class="label">Daily quest</p><p class="val">Complete today's challenge</p><p class="sub">Earn XP and maintain your streak.</p></div></a><a class="card art" href="#lessons"><div class="dash-icon">▣</div><div><p class="label">Lessons</p><p class="val">Continue learning</p><p class="sub">Live, scheduled and missed lessons.</p></div></a><a class="card art" href="#compete"><div class="dash-icon">VS</div><div><p class="label">Compete</p><p class="val">Challenge mode</p><p class="sub">Your competitive area lives here.</p></div></a></div></section>
  <aside class="dashboard-side"><p class="label">Your identity</p><h2 id="dashId">WR-2026-0001</h2><p id="dashClass">Class</p><p id="dashSchool">School</p><div class="xp-track"><i id="xpBar"></i></div><p class="note" id="xpNext">0 / 100 XP to next rank</p></aside></div>
  <section class="updates"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="label">White Room news</p><h2 class="big small">Updates</h2></div></div><div id="posts"><p class="muted">Loading...</p></div></section>
</div></section>

<section id="lessons" class="view"><div class="wrap"><h1 class="page-title"><span class="hl">Lessons</span></h1><p class="lead">Your lessons are shared by White Room staff and tracked against your account.</p><span id="nextSession" hidden></span><span id="dailyHome" hidden></span><div id="gLive"></div><div id="gScheduled"></div><div id="gMissed"></div><div id="cDone"></div><div id="cTrophy" hidden></div></div></section>
<section id="tasks" class="view"><div class="wrap"><h1 class="page-title"><span class="hl">Daily Quest</span></h1><p class="lead">One focused challenge at a time. Your quest results and completed marking quests contribute to your progress.</p><div id="tDaily"></div><div id="tTodo"></div><div class="cards"><a class="card art" href="#quest"><div class="dash-icon">✎</div><div><p class="label">AI marking quest</p><p class="val">Submit handwritten working</p><p class="sub">AI drafts the mark. Staff releases the final result.</p></div></a></div></div></section>
<section id="compete" class="view"><div class="wrap"><h1 class="page-title"><span class="hl">Compete</span></h1><p class="lead">Competition is a separate mode from lessons: accuracy, completion time and rank will matter here.</p><div class="cards"><div class="card art"><div class="dash-icon">VS</div><div><p class="label">Challenge arena</p><p class="val">Competition system</p><p class="sub">The button belongs in the main navigation and on your dashboard so it is always one tap away.</p><span class="lock">Competition rounds are not open yet.</span></div></div></div></div></section>
<section id="rankings" class="view"><div class="wrap"><h1 class="page-title"><span class="hl">Rankings</span></h1><p class="lead">Your position is based primarily on earned XP, with marks used as a tie-breaker.</p><div id="rankList" class="rank-list"><p class="muted">Loading...</p></div></div></section>
<section id="profile" class="view"><div class="wrap"><h1 class="page-title"><span class="hl">Profile</span></h1><div id="profileCard" class="profile-card"></div><div id="achievementList"></div></div></section>
<section id="staff" class="view"><div class="wrap teacher staff-dashboard"><div class="staff-title"><div><p class="label">WHITE ROOM // HEAD STAFF</p><h1 class="page-title"><span class="hl">Management Dashboard</span></h1><p class="lead">Operational overview first. Open individual student records only when management action is required.</p></div><img class="staff-concept" src="assets/head-staff-dashboard-concept.png" alt="White Room head staff dashboard concept"></div><div class="staff-panel staff-actions"><button id="issueKey" class="btn blue">Issue admission key</button><button id="issueFive" class="btn white">Issue 5 keys</button><button id="staffRefresh" class="btn white">Refresh data</button><span id="staffNote" class="note"></span><div id="newKeys"></div></div><div class="manager-grid"><article class="manager-card"><span>Total students</span><b id="mTotal">0</b><small>All admitted accounts</small></article><article class="manager-card"><span>Active students</span><b id="mActive">0</b><small>Students with recorded activity</small></article><article class="manager-card"><span>Pending admissions</span><b id="mPending">0</b><small>Unused admission keys</small></article><article class="manager-card alert"><span>Awaiting marking</span><b id="mAwaiting">0</b><small>Requires staff review</small></article><article class="manager-card"><span>Average performance</span><b id="mPerformance">0%</b><small>Across recorded marks</small></article><article class="manager-card"><span>Released reviews</span><b id="mReleased">0</b><small>Final results released</small></article></div><div class="manager-columns"><section class="manager-panel"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="label">Activity</p><h2 class="big small">Recent students</h2></div></div><div id="staffRecent"></div></section><section class="manager-panel"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="label">Progression</p><h2 class="big small">Rank distribution</h2></div></div><div class="rank-distribution"><div><span>S</span><b id="rankS">0</b></div><div><span>A</span><b id="rankA">0</b></div><div><span>B</span><b id="rankB">0</b></div><div><span>C</span><b id="rankC">0</b></div><div><span>D</span><b id="rankD">0</b></div><div><span>E</span><b id="rankE">0</b></div></div></section></div></div></section>
<section id="staff-review" class="view"><div class="wrap teacher"><p class="label">HEAD STAFF // MARKING</p><h1 class="page-title"><span class="hl">Marking Review</span></h1><p class="lead">AI drafts are not final. Staff reviews the student's work and releases the official result.</p><div class="review-summary"><b id="queuePending">0</b> awaiting review · <b id="queueReleased">0</b> released</div><div id="staffItems"></div><h2 class="big small staff-subhead">Recently released</h2><div id="staffReleased"></div></div></section>
<section id="staff-students" class="view"><div class="wrap teacher"><p class="label">HEAD STAFF // RECORDS</p><h1 class="page-title"><span class="hl">Student Management</span></h1><p class="lead">Use this area for individual records. The main dashboard deliberately keeps credentials out of the managerial overview.</p><div class="student-management-note">Student credentials are intentionally not displayed on the Head Staff dashboard. Open a record here when account-level action is needed.</div><div id="staffStudents"></div></div></section>
<section id="staff-admissions" class="view"><div class="wrap teacher"><p class="label">HEAD STAFF // ADMISSIONS</p><h1 class="page-title"><span class="hl">Admission Keys</span></h1><p class="lead">Issue controlled one-time keys to students you have approved.</p><div class="admission-hero"><img src="assets/student-dashboard-concept.png" alt="White Room student account concept"><div><h2 class="big small">Controlled registration</h2><p>Each key can create one student account. The student then receives a permanent White Room ID.</p><button class="btn blue" onclick="document.querySelector('#issueKey').click()">Generate a key</button></div></div></div></section>
<section id="staff-compete" class="view"><div class="wrap teacher"><p class="label">HEAD STAFF // COMPETITIONS</p><h1 class="page-title"><span class="hl">Competition Management</span></h1><p class="lead">Competition management will use the same student identities, ranks and progression system.</p><div class="competition-admin"><img src="assets/student-compete-concept.png" alt="White Room competition concept"><div><h2 class="big small">Compete is a separate mode</h2><p>Staff will create rounds, set dates, select eligible students and publish results from this area.</p><span class="lock">Competition management is staged for the next progression phase.</span></div></div></div></section>
<section id="quest" class="view"><div class="wrap q"><h1 class="page-title"><span class="hl">Marking Quest</span></h1><p class="lead">Solve the question on paper, upload your working, check the transcription, then submit it for staff review.</p><div id="qPicker" class="qpicker"></div><div class="qcard"><p class="label" id="qMeta"></p><h2 id="qTitle">Loading...</h2><div id="qText"></div></div><div class="qstep"><h3><span class="n">1</span> Your working</h3><label class="btn white qpick" for="qFile">Take or choose photo</label><input id="qFile" type="file" accept="image/*" multiple hidden><div id="qThumbs" class="thumbs"></div><div class="qrow"><button id="qRead" class="btn blue" disabled>Read my photo</button><button id="qType" class="btn white" type="button">Type it instead</button></div><p id="qNote1" class="note"></p></div><div class="qstep" id="qStep2" hidden><h3><span class="n">2</span> Check what was read</h3><p class="note">Fix any reading errors. The AI marks exactly what is in this box.</p><textarea id="qBox" rows="7" spellcheck="false"></textarea><div class="qrow"><button id="qMark" class="btn blue">Submit for marking</button></div><p id="qNote2" class="note"></p></div><div id="qResult" class="qstep" hidden></div></div></section>
<section id="session" class="view sess"><div class="sbar"><a class="back" href="#lessons">← Back</a><b id="sTitle"></b><span id="sMarks" class="status"></span></div><div class="sprog"><i id="sProg"></i></div><div class="spanes"><div class="spane" id="sPrompt"><details class="qbox" id="qBox" open><summary>Question</summary><div id="sQuestion"></div></details><div id="sCur"></div></div><div class="spane work" id="sWork"><h3 id="sWorkTitle">Your working</h3><div id="sLines"><p class="muted" id="sEmpty">Each block you finish is written here, line by line.</p></div></div></div></section>
</main><footer><div class="wrap"><p class="sign">— Step by step —</p><a href="#home">Dashboard</a><a href="#quest">Marking Quest</a><a href="#compete">Compete</a></div></footer>
</div>
<script src="app.js"></script><script src="lessons.js"></script><script src="quest.js"></script><script src="staff.js"></script>
</body></html>
